    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against the oncoming ice army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon spirits with Shugu's magical wand to repel enemies before they reach your defense line. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use only the left mouse button to control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share your gameplay on any social media or video platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >June 19, 2025: English interface is now supported. Please select the language from the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2025/06/19 Version 0.3.0-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English can now be selected in the language selection menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full screen can now be selected from the settings screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty of some stages has been adjusted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other specification changes and bug fixes have been made</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2025/02/04 Version 0.1.0-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first release version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Easy mode and 5 stages are available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only player character that can be selected is Shugu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Future version updates-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAddition of stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAddition of Hard mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAddition of player characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version updates will be made from time to time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against the oncoming ice army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon spirits with Shugu's magical wand to repel enemies before they reach your defense line. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use only the left mouse button to control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share your gameplay on any social media or video platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >June 19, 2025: English interface is now supported. Please select the language from the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2025/06/19 Version 0.3.0-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English can now be selected in the language selection menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full screen can now be selected from the settings screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty of some stages has been adjusted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other specification changes and bug fixes have been made</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2025/02/04 Version 0.1.0-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first release version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Easy mode and 5 stages are available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only player character that can be selected is Shugu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Future version updates-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAddition of stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAddition of Hard mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAddition of player characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version updates will be made from time to time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
